#: templates/legacy/import_start.html:6
msgid ""
"Imports everything from the previous webshop that PackDesk knows: the catalogue, "
"customers with addresses, contacts and logins (with their own passwords), "
"orders, licences with options and extensions, invoices with payments, and "
"the number counters."
msgstr "Importiert alles aus dem vorherigen Webshop, was PackDesk kennt: den Katalog, Kunden mit Adressen, Ansprechpartner und Logins (mit ihrem eigenen Passwort), Bestellungen, Lizenzen mit Optionen und Verlängerungen, Rechnungen mit Zahlungen und die Nummernzähler."

#: templates/legacy/import_start.html:7
msgid ""
"Uses the table mappings of this database. Running it again updates what was "
"imported before and never creates anything twice; nothing in PackDesk is "
"deleted. Every row of the old database ends up in the report, with what "
"happened to it."
